    "media:imagetext": "PORTLAND \u0026 SEATTLE\nSAN\nFRANCISCO\nSACRAMENTO\nOAKLAND\nSAN\nJOSE\nBURBANK\nSANTA\nANA\nONTARIO\nPALM SPRINGS\nSAN DIEGO\nSERVICE BEGINS.\nIN EARLY 1970\nPresent Routes\nProposed Routes\nReservations and\nInformation\nNorthern\nCalifornia Cities\nSAN FRANCISCO\n(415) 433-2660\nOAKLAND\n(415) 562-8200\nSAN JOSE\n(408) 286-7870\nFor Other Bay Area Cities\nCall ENTERPRISE 1-6346\nSouthern\nCalifornia Cities\nORANGE COUNTY\n(714) 540-4550\nONTARIO\n(714) 983-2743\nPALM SPRINGS\n(714) 327-8556\nFor Other Southern California\nCities Call ZENITH 7-0799\nAIR\nCALIFORNIA\nFirst Cabin\nCarriage\nNew Food n' Fun-fare on Air\nCalifornia!A party-as youfly!\nFAMILY FARES\nOne child, under two years old, not\noccupying a seat may fly free when ac-\ncompanied by a passenger twelve years\nold or over. All children under twelve\nmay fly for one-half fare.\nMILITARY FARES\nMilitary personnel on leave may travel\nat 66% fare on a space available basis.\nConsult your Air California agent for\ndetails.\nCREDIT CARDS\nAir California honors American Express,\nBankAmericard, Carte Blanche, Diners'\nClub, Barclay Card Chargex, American\nTorch Club and Master Charge Card.\nGROUP SALES\nAND AIR CARGO\nAir California maintains sales offices in\nboth Orange County and San Francisco\nwith corporate offices in Orange County.\nFor further information call or write: Air\nCalifornia, 4400 Campus Drive, Newport\nBeach, 92660\nCity Ticket Offices:\n460 Post Street\nSan Francisco, California 94102\n777 South Main Street Suite 121\nOrange, California 92668\n(Town and Country Shopping Center)",
